course: dictionary
lesson: 6818
title: One word, three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. Oscar is one of them. The words around it are its context, and they tell you which meaning you need.
explain: Listen for a small clue. «An Oscar» means the gold statue. Oscar on its own, as a name, means a person. «Oscar argued for ten minutes that a whale is a fish.» Here Oscar is a boy, because he argued.
explain: The Oscars are a famous film award show in Hollywood, USA. The top prize is a gold statue, also called an Academy Award. On the radio, Oscar means the letter O, because pilots, police and sailors use it so letters are not misheard.
fact: Oscar has three meanings: a gold statue given as a film prize, a boy's name, and the letter O in the spelling alphabet.
fact: An Oscar is a gold statue given each year as a top prize for films. It is also called an Academy Award.
fact: «Oscar argued for ten minutes that a whale is a fish.» Here Oscar is a boy's name.
fact: Pilots, police and sailors say Oscar for the letter O, so that it is not misheard, like Alpha, Bravo, Charlie, Oscar.
exercise: «Oscar argued for ten minutes that a whale is a fish.» In this sentence, what is Oscar? | The letter O | A gold statue | A film show in Hollywood | *A boy's name
exercise: Pilots say "Oscar" on the radio. What does it stand for? | A gold statue | *The letter O | A film show | A boy in class
exercise: In the film world, what is an Oscar? | *A gold statue given as a top prize for films | A famous city in the USA | A boy's name | A type of breakfast cereal
test: «Mum watches the breakfast show while Oscar eats his cereal.» Who is Oscar in this sentence? | *A boy | The letter O | A gold statue | A kind of cereal
test: Which is the Oscars? | *A famous film award show in Hollywood, USA | A boy's name | The letter O in the spelling alphabet | A radio pilot
exam: Jayden hears "an Oscar" on TV. What does the word mean here? | A boy's name | A kind of bird | The letter O | *A gold statue given as a film prize
